# Drop your zbpm signing keys here.
#
# zbpm looks for one of:
#   /etc/zbpm/keys/zbpm.kbx   (modern GnuPG keybox)
#   /etc/zbpm/keys/zbpm.gpg   (legacy keyring, accepted by gpgv)
#
# Generate a keybox from a public key with:
#   gpg --no-default-keyring --keyring /etc/zbpm/keys/zbpm.gpg --import zbpm-pub.asc
#
# Permissions on this directory must be 0700, owned by root.
